   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.9,
    299.0,
    531.5,
    312.2
   ],
   "text": "concluded that the hospitality staff failed to take action to combat and/or prevent the spread of",
   "conf": 0.9938,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.9,
    313.0,
    531.1,
    324.9
   ],
   "text": "the fire onboard the vessel. However, based on the facts of the case, my office believes that the",
