   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.1,
    339.3,
    539.9,
    352.1
   ],
   "text": "persons onboard given the minimal shipboard emergency training they received and the fact that",
   "conf": 0.9957,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.1,
    351.7,
    345.4,
    365.7
   ],
   "text": "the trained marine crew had already departed the vessel.",
   "conf": 0.9981,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    73.7,
    377.6,
    519.6,
    391.2
   ],
   "text": "Therefore, we disagree with the presupposition by the investigation team that the hospitality",
